  "Effect of mechanochemical events on extraterrestrial organic matter and its implications for exogenous delivery": "メカノケミカルな事象が地球外有機物に及ぼす影響と、その外来供給への示唆",
  "Oral presentation · BEACON 2025": "口頭発表 · BEACON 2025",
